	(text "USB VBUS input FETs" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16.51 26.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid "12d8174e-a601-571f-96f1-447c95edfdaf"))
	(text "USB_VBUS from header J10 (main-board USB-C). BQ25798 figure 8-2 port 1: ACFET1 M1 / RBFET1 M2 back-to-back, sources joined, gates on ACDRV1 through R11; VAC1 senses USB_VBUS (Charger\nsheet). C1 0.1u at the FET input" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16.51 31.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "29ec2e36-66ea-5d6e-8379-62194a4a02f2"))
	(rectangle (start 15.24 127.0) (end 203.2 228.6) (stroke (width 0.3) (type dash) (color 30 90 170 1)) (fill (type color) (color 190 215 250 0.35)) (uuid "6dfce77e-8a55-52bc-9721-ca2ff94ea47e"))
	(text "PV input" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16.51 128.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid "c54c7950-04be-5a85-a097-549d87a3e1d1"))
	(text "5 W 6 V class panel (Voc about 8 V cold, under 1 A): JST PH J5 (1 +, 2 -); SMBJ10A D1 across the pair (clamp 17 V < 30 V abs max); CM choke L3 3 A; figure 8-2 port 2: ACFET2 M3 / RBFET2\nM4 into VBUS (ACDRV2)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 16.51 133.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8af6cf7c-731a-5353-9889-e0da84f59a4b"))
	(rectangle (start 213.36 25.4) (end 401.32 147.32) (stroke (width 0.3) (type dash) (color 30 90 170 1)) (fill (type color) (color 190 215 250 0.35)) (uuid "b954ac1d-bd98-545c-a6ad-040665e52136"))
	(text "Board-to-board header J10 (J_PWR)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 214.63 26.42 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid "6eed6f3d-cde6-5db0-af30-0897fe8913ba"))
	(text "Keyed 2x10 2.54 mm socket, hand-soldered, hole 3 blocked (key). SYS out (pins 1, 2, >= 1 A), USB_VBUS in (19, 20), D+/D- in (BC1.2 detection), charger I2C/INT/CE to the main board. A GND\npair between signal pairs. Pin map: hardware/ARCHITECTURE.md" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 214.63 31.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "3b326b24-97b3-5baa-b9d3-cd45d18b0105"))
	(text "J10 pin map (hardware/ARCHITECTURE.md), keyed 2x10: pin 3 is the key (no pin, hole blocked)\npins 1, 2: SYS, power board -> main board: system rail (cell-referred, 1.8-5.5 V), at least 1 A\npins 4, 5, 6, 9, 10, 13, 14, 17, 18: GND (a GND pair between every signal pair)\npins 7, 8: USB_DP, USB_DN, main -> power: BC1.2 detection only (BQ25798 D+/D-)\npins 11, 12: CHG_SDA, CHG_SCL: charger I2C (address 0x6B), 10k pull-ups on the main board\npin 15: CHG_INT, power -> main: open drain, 10k pull-up on the main board\npin 16: CHG_CE, main -> power: active low, pulled high (charge off) until firmware drives it low\npins 19, 20: USB_VBUS, main -> power: USB-C VBUS to ACFET1 drain and VAC1\nRotated, mirrored or column-shifted plugs hit the key (tools/header_check.py). No 3.3 V on the power board." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 218.44 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "35d3d920-2daa-5c11-a0a3-13f58c261eeb"))
